#. ~ Description of monster "sewer slime"
#: data/json/monsters/slimes.json
msgid ""
"This moving, black glob emits a foul stench.  It has incorporated both the "
"liquid and solid contents of the sewer water."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Death message of monster "sewer slime"
#: data/json/monsters/slimes.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s bursts, releasing its vile contents!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "triffid"
#: data/json/monsters/triffid.json
msgid ""
"A creeping mobile plant, as tall as a moose.  It has a single bark-covered "
"stalk supporting a flowery head with a paralyzing sting concealed within.  "
"Nature is healing."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/triffid.json
msgid "fungicidal triffid"
msgid_plural "fungicidal triffids"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

