#. ~ Description of monster "lashing zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_tentacle.json
msgid ""
"This zombie has very elongated arms.  While they're menacingly long, they "
"seem quite thin and floppy, as if they lack bones."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
