#. ~ Description of monster "Stiltwalker"
#: data/json/monsters/netherum/labyrinth_monsters.json
msgid ""
"This lanky, quadrupedal entity has a loosely humanoid torso, towering high "
"over the ground on long bladed legs.  Its body is covered in what looks like "
"fur made of rusting, metallic wire, and its face is a polished, hollow mask "
"with holes where the mouth and eyes should be."
msgstr ""
